{"answer_text":"Deal management has consolidated around a few strong products. The ones getting the most attention this year:\n\n**Northwind CRM Revenue Cloud**\nExcellent forecasting and territory tools, but setup usually needs a dedicated admin.\n\n**Halcyon Sales Pro**\nSolid pipeline views with built-in calling; the reporting needs some setup.\n\n**Kestrel CRM**\nAuto-logs emails and meetings to deals, so pipelines stay current.\n\n**Orbitly**\nCan model a pipeline as a board, but has no forecasting.\n\n**Tallyfox**\nDrag-and-drop pipelines with weighted forecasts — lighter than enterprise tools, but enough for most B2B teams under 50 reps.\n\n**Sheetly**\nFine for a handful of deals, not for a real pipeline.\n\nPick Northwind CRM for breadth, or Halcyon Sales if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50e3-732b-bf77-ca593237eb0e","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:34.850Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["best crm 2026 list","top deal management apps 2026"],"latency_ms":12720,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[113,126],[695,708]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889c3d4225fd","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Halcyon Sales","name_text":"Halcyon Sales","offsets":[[232,245],[725,738]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-5864-7406-ad9e-7a3